    "description": "Colección de la API de Pyme Hub (MVP, TFM EUDE).\n\nUso: 1) importa también el entorno de docs/coleccion; 2) ejecuta 'Login' (guarda la cookie y el token CSRF); 3) las peticiones que modifican datos envían X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}.\nContrato completo: docs/openapi.yaml. Se amplía con cada avance (v0.3.0: bienestar y alertas).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · Salud",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Estado de la API",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pública. API, base de datos, disco y última copia (RNF-061)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 · Autenticación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "RF-001. Guarda la cookie de sesión (Postman la gestiona sola) y el token CSRF en {{csrf}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.csrf_token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('csrf', j.data.csrf_token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Mi sesión (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "RF-011. Usuario, perfil, empresa, plan, features y token CSRF."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.csrf_token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('csrf', j.data.csrf_token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
